                    <li>Where relevant the Board takes account of the impact of the Group's operations on the community and environment. All of the management teams are keenly aware of customer feedback on the environment and aim to make products as sustainable and recyclable as possible, for example through compliance with ethical trading guidelines in the clothing industry, through retail schemes encouraging customers to recycle previous purchases or by using environmentally friendly and recyclable packaging.</li>
                    <li>As the Board of Directors, our intention is to behave responsibly and ensure that management runs the business in a responsible manner, operating within the high standards of business conduct and good governance expected for a business such as ours. This is critical to the success of the businesses, for example where our increasingly discerning and well informed retail customers are concerned in matters such as data protection or sustainability.</li>
